GatedDeltaNet and fusions

Folded from the old patches: 0003, 0050, 0051, 0057, 0066, 0074, 0081, 0082, 0086, 0087, 0090, 0091.

GatedDeltaNet on Intel: the kernel, snapshots into the cache, gating folded in, the generation-verify kernel, state rows, the replay op and its memory; the rope-apply and QK-norm-rope fusions.

The old patch files (named in FOLDED.md) are history; the section for each old number
in contrib/llama.cpp/README.md still describes its measurements. This file is the
diff between the tree after the previous folded patch and the tree after this one;
the sum of all folded patches is byte-identical to the old series applied in order.

